---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "广州旅行指南：美食之都与贸易中心";
const description = "广州完全指南——中国南方第一大都市，粤菜发源地，景点与交通全攻略。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/cities/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        返回城市指南
      </a>
    </nav>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏙️ 广州</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">广州旅行指南：美食之都与贸易中心</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">广州完全指南——中国南方第一大都市，粤菜发源地，景点与交通全攻略。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读时间：7分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-cyan-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">⚡ 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">广州是<strong>粤菜的发源地</strong>，也是一座拥有2000多年历史的国际贸易中心。作为珠三角的核心城市，它是仅次于北京和上海的中国第三大城市。\"食在广州\"并非虚言——这里不仅是早茶文化的发祥地，更汇聚了世界各地的美食。每年春秋两届的广交会吸引着全球采购商云集于此。历史建筑与现代摩天大楼交相辉映，构成了广州独特的城市风貌。</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 本指南目录</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#why-visit" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏙️ 为什么要去广州</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-many-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📅 需要几天</a></li>
        <li><a href="#attractions" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎯 热门景点</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 市内交通</a></li>
        <li><a href="#where-to-stay" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏨 住在哪里</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-to-eat" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍜 吃什么</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="why-visit" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🏙️ 为什么要去广州</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">\"食在广州\"这四个字足以说明一切。粤菜被认为是中国最精致、最讲究的菜系之一，而广州正是它的发源地。作为海上丝绸之路的起点之一，2000多年的商贸历史赋予了这座城市浓郁的国际色彩。珠江畔的现代都市景观与老城区的骑楼老街形成迷人的对比。广州毗邻深圳和香港，也是探索珠三角区域的最佳起点。</p>

    <h2 id="how-many-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">📅 需要几天</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>2-3天（标准）：</strong>越秀公园、陈家祠、沙面岛、广州塔，体验早茶</li>
      <li><strong>4-5天（宽松）：</strong>增加深圳或香港一日游、珠江夜游</li>
      <li><strong>6天以上（深度）：</strong>前往开平碉楼或肇庆的山水秘境</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- ==================== ATTRACTIONS ==================== -->
    <h2 id="attractions" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🎯 热门景点</h2>

    <!-- Canton Tower -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/guangzhou/canton-tower.webp" alt="广州塔，纤腰旋转的电视塔" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">广州塔</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">广州的地标，高600米，是中国最高的电视塔之一。优雅的扭腰造型使其在广州天际线中独树一帜。观景台可俯瞰珠江和广州全景，塔顶还有旋转餐厅。夜晚灯光亮起，整座塔身璀璨夺目。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Shamian Island -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/guangzhou/shamian-island.webp" alt="沙面岛的欧式建筑与林荫道" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">沙面岛</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">珠江上的一个小岛，完好保存着19世纪欧洲殖民时期的建筑。这里曾是欧洲领事馆所在地，绿树成荫的街道和欧式建筑营造出宁静的异国风情。咖啡馆和画廊点缀其间，是悠闲散步的好去处。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Chen Clan Academy -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/guangzhou/chen-clan-academy.webp" alt="陈家祠的精美雕刻建筑" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">陈家祠</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">广东文化的集大成者，19世纪的宗祠建筑，以精妙绝伦的雕刻和装饰著称。屋顶上色彩鲜艳的陶塑人物、墙面精细的木雕和石雕，堪称广东传统工艺的巅峰之作，已被列入世界文化遗产。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Yuexiu Park -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/guangzhou/yuexiu-park.webp" alt="越秀公园的五羊石像" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">越秀公园</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">广州最大的城市公园，以广州标志\"五羊石像\"闻名。园内有镇海楼（广州博物馆）和明代古城墙等历史遗迹。这里是市民休闲的好去处，早晨可见打太极的人，傍晚有散步的市民。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pearl River Night Cruise -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/guangzhou/pearl-river-night.webp" alt="珠江夜游，灯光璀璨的广州夜景" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">珠江夜游</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">夜晚游览广州的经典方式。乘船巡游珠江，欣赏广州塔、珠江新城摩天大楼群、海珠桥等夜景精华。约1小时的航程让你尽情领略广州迷人的夜色。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Beijing Road -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="float-left mr-8 mb-4 w-full md:w-80 lg:w-96 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/guangzhou/beijing-road.webp" alt="北京路步行街" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">北京路步行街</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">广州最繁华的商业步行街，路面玻璃之下可见宋、明、清三代的古道遗址，历史与现代在此交融。周边购物中心、餐厅和小吃摊林立，无论本地人还是游客，这里总是热闹非凡。</p>
      <div class="clear-both"></div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🚇 市内交通</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>地铁：</strong>广州地铁网络发达，覆盖几乎所有主要景点。有英文标识。详情见<a href="/zh/transport/metro-bus/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">中国主要城市地铁公交指南</a>。</li>
      <li><strong>滴滴：</strong>全市通用，十分方便。设置方法见<a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">外国人在中国使用滴滴指南</a>。</li>
      <li><strong>出租车：</strong>价格实惠，去机场和火车站首选。</li>
      <li><strong>BRT快速公交：</strong>广州拥有中国领先的快速公交系统，专用车道连接主要区域，速度堪比地铁。</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="where-to-stay" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🏨 住在哪里</h2>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">珠江新城——首次游客首选</h3><p class="text-gray-700">广州新CBD，高档酒店、购物中心和餐厅云集，靠近广州塔和花城广场。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">沙面/荔湾区——文化爱好者首选</h3><p class="text-gray-700">历史氛围浓郁，能感受地道的广州生活。传统粤菜名店众多，适合散步探索。</p></div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">天河区——商务旅客首选</h3><p class="text-gray-700">另一个商业中心，地铁交通便利，购物餐饮选择丰富。</p></div>

    <!-- ==================== WHAT TO EAT ==================== -->
    <h2 id="what-to-eat" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🍜 吃什么</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">\"食在广州\"——这里是美食爱好者的天堂，也是早茶文化的发源地。</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 p-3">
          <img src="/images/guangzhou/food/dimsum.webp" alt="广式点心" class="max-w-full max-h-56 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="p-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">早茶——点心</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base">广州引以为傲的饮食文化。小蒸笼里不断端出的各色点心——虾饺、烧卖、肠粉、凤爪等多达数百种。边喝热茶，边与家人朋友聊天慢享，是广州人传统的早晨生活方式。周末老字号茶楼前，本地人排起长队等候一笼笼点心。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 p-3">
          <img src="/images/guangzhou/food/wonton-noodles.webp" alt="云吞面" class="max-w-full max-h-56 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="p-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">云吞面</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base">广州的经典面食。鲜虾和猪肉调馅的云吞，配上劲道的竹升面，盛入用大地鱼（比目鱼干）和猪骨熬制的清澈高汤。一碗下肚，满足感油然而生，是广州人早餐或午餐的热门选择。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 p-3">
          <img src="/images/guangzhou/food/roast-goose.webp" alt="广式烧鹅" class="max-w-full max-h-56 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="p-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">广式烧鹅</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base">广式烧味中的极品。整鹅以秘制酱料腌制后慢火烤制，外皮酥脆，肉质鲜嫩多汁。秘制酱汁渗入每一丝肉中，甜咸交织，回味无穷。斩件上桌，佐以酸梅酱，是粤式餐桌上的硬菜。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 p-3">
          <img src="/images/guangzhou/food/claypot-rice.webp" alt="煲仔饭" class="max-w-full max-h-56 object-contain" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="p-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">煲仔饭</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base">瓦煲中现煮的广式米饭，米饭上铺满腊肠、鸡肉或牛肉等配料，淋上酱油后在炭火上煲出焦香。最迷人的是瓦煲底部那层金黄酥脆的锅巴。整煲热气腾腾地上桌，拌匀后开吃，是广州人冬日里的暖心美食。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="not-prose mt-16">
          <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 mt-8">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-50 to-blue-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-xl p-5 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">📚 继续阅读</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="/zh/cities/city-select/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              🗺️ 中国旅行需要几天
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/zh/cities/shenzhen-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              🏙️ 深圳旅行指南
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/zh/transport/high-speed-rail/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              🚄 中国高铁预订与乘坐指南
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              💳 中国支付方式指南
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
